"""
`TNNModel` for a machine rated to 250 °C: the same normaliser, conductance and
power-loss blocks, with the de-normalisation ceiling raised from the 200 °C the
Paderborn dataset is scaled to.

A one-line `extends` clones the whole component — ports, sub-components, wiring
and icon come across — and `MAX_TEMP` reaches `Normalizer` and
`TemperatureOutputs` because `TNNModel` already forwards it. The calibration
shipped in `assets/data/calibrated_params.csv` is scaled to 200 °C, so this
variant wants a training run of its own.
"""
component HighTempTNNModel
  extends MotorTemperatureSciML.Models.TNNModel(MAX_TEMP = 250.0)
end
